sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Cat as Catalog API\n(.NET 11 Minimal API)
	participant PG as PostgreSQL\n(catalogdb)
	participant Sched as Scheduler\n(Quartz.NET)
	participant Kafka as Kafka Broker\n(scheduler.process-vector-batch)
	participant Ingest as Catalog Ingestion\n(Azure Functions)
	participant AI as Microsoft Foundry\n(Cohere EmbedV40)
	participant Qdrant as Qdrant\n(vectordb)

	Cat ->> PG: Commit book create / update / soft-delete
	PG ->> PG: Trigger upserts pending_vector_updates (book_id, revision)
	Sched ->> Kafka: Every 5 min UTC: ProcessVectorBatchIntegrationEvent
	Kafka ->> Ingest: KafkaTrigger (group: catalog-ingestion)
	Ingest ->> PG: SELECT pg_try_advisory_lock(740031001)

	alt Lock held by another run or queue empty
		PG -->> Ingest: Lock busy / 0 pending rows (exit cleanly)
	else Lock acquired with up to 200 rows
		Ingest ->> PG: Read up to 200 pending_vector_updates joined with books
		Ingest ->> AI: Generate embeddings for active books
		AI -->> Ingest: Embedding vectors
		Ingest ->> Qdrant: Upsert active TextSnippets & delete removed books
		Ingest ->> PG: DELETE FROM pending_vector_updates WHERE book_id & revision match
		Ingest ->> PG: SELECT pg_advisory_unlock(740031001)
	end
